OL,4,CGTA 6 breaks records as estimated      
OL,5,Csales top $2.3bn                       
OL,6,GGrand Theft Auto 6 is estimated to     
OL,7,Ghave become the biggest entertainment  
OL,8,Glaunch in history following the        
OL,9,Gblockbuster video game's debut on      
OL,10,GThursday, after a 13-year wait.        
OL,12,FThe highly anticipated open-world      
OL,13,Faction-adventure saw pre-orders and    
OL,14,Ffirst day sales total more than 24.5   
OL,15,Fmillion units, raking in about $2.36bn 
OL,16,F(#1.8bn), according to analytics       
OL,17,Fplatform Sensor Tower.                 
